            "quote": {
              "text": "Yes, I'd like to take the next step. Please provide me with the contact information and application form. I'm looking forward to volunteering at the food bank and making a difference in my community. By the way, I'm glad I got to attend the Maundy Thursday service at the Episcopal Church today, it was a beautiful and moving experience."
